{
  "path": "/clients/{id}{format}",
  "method": "delete",
  "operation": {
    "summary": "Delete Clients",
    "deprecated": false,
    "description": "MUTATING operation. Verify target and authorized intent; reconcile outcome before retry. Deletes a client by ID.\n\nA client can only be deleted when it has no related records. The request is rejected if the client still has transactions (invoices, payments, etc.), a related installment agreement, an attendance log, a rental reservation or manufacturing order (`400`), or an active membership / credit charge (`500`). Returns `404` if no client matches the ID. Requires a permission to delete the client.",
